WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,880
It's her! She is Wei Ren! Me?

2
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:08,030
That’s right! It’s you! You’re the only one here who fits the profile

3
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:09,630
I just checked you

4
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:15,470
I really am not!

5
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,070
I don’t think she looks like Weiren.

6
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:20,470
You question me as a prophet

7
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:25,930
It was made very clear on the radio

8
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:27,530
There is only one prophet

9
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,580
I am the prophet

10
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,820
So either Zhang Lei is Wei Ren

11
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:35,360
Or he's an ordinary person who falsely reported his identity.

12
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:41,670
passed first

13
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:42,870
prophet

14
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:47,900
Please start your prediction information

15
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,700
The left shell of the utility room points downwards

16
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,700
There is a key under the third brick

17
00:00:51,700 --> 00:01:23,210
I can open the door key next to the utility room. Is it possible to escape from the refrigerator?
